       "<Figure size 800x200 with 4 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "f = plt.figure(figsize=(8, 2))\n",
    "styles = [\"darkgrid\", \"white\", \"ticks\", \"whitegrid\"]\n",
    "gs = f.add_gridspec(1, len(styles))\n",
    "for i, style in enumerate(styles):\n",
    "    with sns.axes_style(style):\n",
    "        ax = f.add_subplot(gs[i])\n",
    "        sinplot(6)\n",
    "        ax.set_title(style)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "52d11bab",
   "metadata": {
    "editable": true,
    "slideshow": {
     "slide_type": "fragment"
    },
    "tags": []
   },
   "source": [
    "The `ticks` style is probably the most commonly used. The easiest way to set the style, however, is to just run `set_style` once at the top of a notebook. That will set the style for all plots from that point on. "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "7f613639",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "sns.set_style(\"ticks\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "898be7f1",
   "metadata": {
    "editable": true,
    "slideshow": {
     "slide_type": "slide"
    },
    "tags": []
   },
   "source": [
    "## Distribution plots\n",
    "\n",
    "In Seaborn, there are multiple ways to visualize a distribution of observations. Before, we used `plt.hist` to make histograms. Seaborn lets us quickly make histograms from DataFrames more flexibly."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "87a54be1",
   "metadata": {
    "editable": true,
    "slideshow": {
     "slide_type": "slide"
    },
    "tags": []
   },
   "source": [
    "To make a distribution plot, we can use the `displot` function. The `kind` variable determines how the distribution is visualized.\n",
    "\n",
    "histplot\n",
    ": summarize data in bins using a histogram.\n",
    "\n",
    "kdeplot\n",
    ": summarize data with a kernel density estimation plot."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2b408a1c",
   "metadata": {
    "editable": true,
    "slideshow": {
     "slide_type": "slide"
    },
    "tags": []
   },
   "source": [
