   "source": [
    "## Categorical plots\n",
    "\n",
    "In Seaborn, categorical plots are used to visualize one or more distributions (usually at least two). For example, \"categories\" might correspond to different experimental conditions."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
