    "slideshow": {
     "slide_type": "slide"
    },
    "tags": []
   },
   "source": [
    "A common type of plot for visualizing different conditions is called a *bar plot*. Let's make a bar plot showing the probability of responding \"old\" in the target and lure conditions."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 18,
   "id": "2504dad6",
   "metadata": {
    "editable": true,
    "slideshow": {
     "slide_type": ""
    },
    "tags": []
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
