   "source": [
    "Here, we've used the FacetGrid object that Seaborn returns to set a property of the figure after making it. We used the `ylim` parameter to indicate that the y-axis should range from 0 (the lowest possible false-alarm rate) to 0.5 (a pretty high false-alarm rate). The plot shows bootstrap confidence intervals, similar to what we had before in our bar plots. Here, there is a confidence *band* that connects the different confidence intervals at each lag.\n",
